<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104915" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐέτ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, or
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριετής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for three years,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριέτεα χρόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.199
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. φορά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					42(1).121.9
				</span></i>
			 (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλέον ἢ τ. ἐγένευ φίλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					29.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				48.518
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Palestine</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. προθεσμία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					954d
				</span></i>
			 (in <i><span class="en">
				793d
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρι᾽ ἔτη</span> is restored by Bekker):
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίετες</span> as Adv.,
				<i>for three years,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.106
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13.377
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>three years old,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					545b13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artem.
					4.39
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίετες, τό,</span>
			<i>the age of three years</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τριέτους μέχρι τῶν ἓξ ἐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					794a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				545b3
			</span></i>:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐετ-έτις</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				6.125
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cotiaeum</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>recurring every three years,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>H.</u>
					53.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
